> Here you are able to download free fonts beginning with letter A. This is nice if you know the name of the free font you are looking up. If[ not,] then you you should be browsing fonts by category.
We hope you enjoyed using our rich font collection. Your next top-pick free font could be at the next page.[][]

=== Text #2 ===
> Routing: This flat and easy roundabout route has the selfsame starting point as the Magic Castle Run, it merely turns off at the entrance into the Giessenbachtal valley. On the trail along the edge of the Karwendel mountain massif are numerous romantic viewpoints. The indicated running time is a guideline and depends on personal fitness.[][][][][][][][][]

